    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d74-a7">

                <pb facs="0214" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg118"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure G.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mackenna to Mr. Root.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 27,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Notwithstanding the Central Society for “Lazeretos “has offered to your
                    excellency the most expressive thanks for your excellent article upon the
                    internal organization of “Lazeretos,” and the curing of their patients, this
                    “Intendencia” takes pleasure in multiplying the manifestations of its especial
                    acknowledgments for a service as opportune <pb facs="0215" n="119"
                        xml:id="pg119"/> as charitable. It is truly a great consolation and a
                    distinguished honor for our enlightened capital to excite sympathies so high and
                    so sincere as those which your excellency has contributed, it being worthy of
                    note that this is perhaps the first occasion in which the representative of a
                    friendly nation has proved to our fellow-citizens by especial acts of
                    self-denial, and of work that appeals to the human soul, which it has been the
                    custom hitherto to leave exclusively to toasts and protocols. God guard your
                    excellency.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>B. VICUÑA MACKENNA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
